{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An encryption wrapper for any Ensembles cloud backend."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Cloud File System","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptedCloudFileSystem"],"anchor":"Cloud-File-System"},{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/VaultInfo"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptionError","doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptionFormat","doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/FileEncryptor"],"anchor":"Enumerations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"EnsemblesEncrypted provides ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptedCloudFileSystem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", a wrapper that encrypts files before uploading and decrypts after downloading. It can wrap any ","type":"text"},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation — CloudKit, Google Drive, WebDAV, or your own custom backend — to provide end-to-end encryption for sync data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Encrypted files are stored in a password-derived vault directory with a ","type":"text"},{"code":".cdecrypt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extension. This is backward compatible with the Ensembles 2 Objective-C ","type":"text"},{"code":"CDEEncryptedCloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Encryption Formats","anchor":"Encryption-Formats","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two encryption formats are available:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".modern"}]},{"text":" (default) — AES-256-GCM. Fast, authenticated encryption using Apple’s CryptoKit. Recommended for new apps.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".legacy"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — RNCryptor v3 format. Use this for backward compatibility with Ensembles 2 encrypted data."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The backend auto-detects the encryption format when downloading, so a ","type":"text"},{"code":".modern","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" client can read ","type":"text"},{"code":".legacy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files and vice versa. The format setting only controls how ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"new"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" files are encrypted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Setup","type":"heading","text":"Setup","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wrap any cloud file system with encryption:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Ensembles","import EnsemblesEncrypted","import EnsemblesCloudKit","","\/\/ Wrap CloudKit with encryption","let cloudKitFS = CloudKitFileSystem(","    privateDatabaseForUbiquityContainerIdentifier: \"iCloud.com.yourcompany.yourapp\",","    schemaVersion: .v2",")","let encryptedFS = EncryptedCloudFileSystem(","    cloudFileSystem: cloudKitFS,","    password: \"user-supplied-password\"",")","","let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MainStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: encryptedFS!",")","try await ensemble?.attachPersistentStore()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For more control over the vault, use the "},{"code":"VaultInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let encryptedFS = EncryptedCloudFileSystem(","    cloudFileSystem: innerFS,","    vaultInfo: vaultInfo,","    encryptionFormat: .modern",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"When-to-Use-Encryption","type":"heading","text":"When to Use Encryption","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensembles sync data is stored as opaque binary files, so even without encryption the raw data is not human-readable. However, it could be deserialized by someone with access to your cloud storage."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CloudKit","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", Apple encrypts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CKAsset"},{"type":"text","text":" data at rest. With Advanced Data Protection (ADP) enabled, assets are end-to-end encrypted. Wrapping CloudKit with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EncryptedCloudFileSystem"},{"type":"text","text":" adds a layer of protection that doesn’t depend on the user enabling ADP."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"third-party backends"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Google Drive, OneDrive, WebDAV, etc.), the storage provider can see the raw files. Wrapping with "},{"code":"EncryptedCloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ensures data is encrypted before it leaves the device, regardless of what the provider does."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"How It Works","anchor":"How-It-Works"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vault directory"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — All encrypted files are stored inside a vault directory in the cloud, derived from the password. Different passwords create different vaults, so the same cloud account can host multiple independent encrypted sync stores.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Upload"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — When Ensembles uploads a file, the wrapper encrypts it to a local temporary file, uploads the encrypted version with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cdecrypt"},{"type":"text","text":" extension, then removes the temporary file."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Download","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — When Ensembles downloads a file, the wrapper downloads the encrypted "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cdecrypt"},{"type":"text","text":" file, auto-detects the format (modern or legacy), decrypts it to a local temporary file, and returns the decrypted content."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backward compatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".legacy"},{"text":" format uses RNCryptor v3, the same encryption format used by Ensembles 2’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CDEEncryptedCloudFileSystem"},{"type":"text","text":". Apps migrating from E2 to E3 can read existing encrypted cloud data without re-encrypting."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Wrapping Other Backends","anchor":"Wrapping-Other-Backends","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wrapper works with any ","type":"text"},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Wrap Google Drive","let encryptedGDrive = EncryptedCloudFileSystem(","    cloudFileSystem: GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: gdAuthenticator),","    password: password",")","","\/\/ Wrap WebDAV","let encryptedWebDAV = EncryptedCloudFileSystem(","    cloudFileSystem: WebDAVCloudFileSystem(baseURL: webdavURL, username: user, password: pass),","    password: encryptionPassword",")"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Dependencies","level":3,"anchor":"Dependencies"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This module has ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no external dependencies"}]},{"text":" beyond Foundation, CryptoKit, and the core ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ensembles"},{"text":" framework.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesEncrypted"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"EnsemblesEncrypted","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"EnsemblesEncrypted","role":"collection"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted"]}],"references":{"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted/EncryptedCloudFileSystem":{"title":"EncryptedCloudFileSystem","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A cloud file system wrapper that encrypts files before uploading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and decrypts them after downloading."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted\/encryptedcloudfilesystem","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EncryptedCloudFileSystem"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EncryptedCloudFileSystem"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptedCloudFileSystem"},"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted/EncryptionError":{"abstract":[{"text":"Errors that can occur during encryption or decryption.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EncryptionError"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EncryptionError"}],"title":"EncryptionError","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptionError","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted\/encryptionerror"},"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An encryption wrapper for any Ensembles cloud backend."}],"role":"collection","title":"EnsemblesEncrypted","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted"},"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted/EncryptionFormat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/EncryptionFormat","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EncryptionFormat"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The encryption format to use when encrypting data."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EncryptionFormat","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EncryptionFormat","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted\/encryptionformat","type":"topic"},"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted/VaultInfo":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/VaultInfo","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VaultInfo","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Represents a vault in an encrypted cloud file system.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"VaultInfo"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"VaultInfo","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted\/vaultinfo","type":"topic"},"doc://EnsemblesEncrypted/documentation/EnsemblesEncrypted/FileEncryptor":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileEncryptor","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Unified encryption\/decryption interface with automatic format detection on decrypt.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensemblesencrypted\/fileencryptor","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileEncryptor","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FileEncryptor","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/documentation\/EnsemblesEncrypted\/FileEncryptor"}}}